WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:09.750
My name is Emily Kennedy and I'm a
Democratic Services Officer. Councillors

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:17.550
receive an allowance of £4570 per
year. We pay mileage for car and cycle

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:23.099
usage and train travel for activities
outside of the district. If you have

00:00:23.099 --> 00:00:27.509
children or other dependents we have a
scheme that can help you to pay for

00:00:27.509 --> 00:00:32.210
their care whilst you attend council
meetings.

